-- T-102 increment 2 (generated by /data/tmp/clinic-dashboard/t102/inc2/gen.py; addendum docs/tasks/T-102.md)
-- T-102 increment 2 (PR-35, TD-32; plan r4 §2 / §Delivery 2; addendum r2 Sol dab12887): Observation, Procedure, Medication, MedicationRequest,
-- MedicationDispense. Re-created: satusehat_materialize, satusehat_release, satusehat_practitioner_link_set (the drift test pins exactly these);
-- new: satusehat_ihs, satusehat_no_search, satusehat_code_map_set; register seed rows (unvalidated). Increment-1 invariants kept: insert-only
-- signing trigger, pinned values per link revision, fingerprint equality before any no-send advance, the barrier, fences, organization binding.

-- The registers for ICD-9 CM (the codes come from the tenant map) and KFA (the codes come from the prescription item); unvalidated.
